L000379	These models are chosen to be non-integrable, to have a single conserved quantity, and to be diffusive at $O(1)$ filling (see next section), and are otherwise not fine-tuned. When models exhibit reliable diffusion at ${\cal O}(1)$ filling, we find a stretched exponential decay of non-hydrodynamic correlation functions, as shown in the final section.
